    "Arduino forum, servo pulse widths": "https://forum.arduino.cc/t/servo-pulse-widths/286525",
    "DroneBot Workshop, ESP32 servo": "https://dronebotworkshop.com/esp32-servo/",
    "Last Minute Engineers, ESP32 servo": "https://lastminuteengineers.com/esp32-servo-motor-tutorial/",
    "Agamem AA51880 servo controller": "http://www.projects.scorchingbay.nz/dokuwiki/_media/electronic/datasheet/agamem/aa51880.pdf",
